Package: GCrutils
Type: Package
Title: R functions & tools for a fast bioinfomatics NGS data analysis and plots
Version: 0.1.0
Author: person('Ying','Sun',,email='bio_sun@foxmail.com',role=c('aut','cre'),comment='The package is maintained by <biosunsci@github>')
Maintainer: 'Ying Sun' <bio_sun@foxmail.com>
Description: Helper functions used by the analysis notebooks of this project:
  file input/output (ysave, ydumpto, yload_dfx), colour schemes, heatmap / volcano / t-SNE
  plots, differential expression (limma, DESeq2) and GSEA / ssGSEA wrappers.
URL: https://github.com/biosunsci/GCrutils
BugReports: https://github.com/biosunsci/GCrutils/issues 
License: MIT license
Encoding: UTF-8
